.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH oct-attestation-statement 1  "oct-attestation-statement " 
.SH "نام (NAME)"
oct\-attestation\-statement \- Print the attestation statement for one of the key slots on the card
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBoct attestation statement\fR [\fB\-c\fR|\fB\-\-card\fR] <\fB\-k\fR|\fB\-\-key\fR> [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Print the attestation statement for one of the key slots on the card
.PP
An attestation statement can only be printed after generating it. See \*(Aqoct attestation generate\*(Aq.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-c\fR, \fB\-\-card\fR \fI<card ident>\fR
Identifier of the card to reset
.TP
\fB\-k\fR, \fB\-\-key\fR \fI<Key slot>\fR
Key slot to use
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
SIG
.IP \(bu 2
DEC
.IP \(bu 2
AUT
.RE
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
